# ⚠️ INTERNAL WORKING DOCUMENTATION — LOCAL ONLY.
#
# Briefs, phase walkthroughs, round progress reports, decision ledgers and
# checklists. They are the record of how the work was done, not part of what
# was delivered, and they have no meaning to anyone who was not in the room.
#
# They remain on the developer's machine. Nothing here is deleted — it is
# simply no longer carried by the repository or copied to the server.
#
# ⚠️ resources/photography/CREDITS.md IS NOT IN THIS LIST, DELIBERATELY.
#
# It is a licence register, not documentation: it records the source and licence
# of every photograph that ships, and CouplesPhotographyTest reads it to stop a
# stand-in image being treated as final. It was swept out with the briefs and
# the suite began erroring on a clean checkout — the local copy hid it.
#
# It stays in the repository and out of the document root. The deploy's *.md
# exclude keeps it off the server, where nothing reads it.
/DEMO.md
/DEPLOY.md
/DEVICE-WALK-LIST.md
/LAUNCH-CHECKLIST.md
/LOAD-BEARING-GUARANTEES.md
/PHASE-*.md
/R[0-9]*-*.md
/SIGNAL-CONSUMERS.md
/docs/
/_backup/
